Don't mean nothin' to you [G7]now but remember [C]when
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[E7]Remember when you're lonely [F]1010 Whippoorwill [C]Lane
And [Am]when you're cold with [C]no one to hold remember this old [G7]flame
[Am]Remember when you're [Em]longing for the [F]love we had back [C]then
[Am]When you need a [C]lover and a [F]friend remember me [G7]remember [C]when
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
